        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e2593a4d-4ec6-532d-b9fe-1410685aca44",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ansel Elgort, Lily James, Neal Dodson, Edgar Wright, Selena Gomez, Jane Lynch, Katia Winter, Rachel Keller, Ashley Williams, Marilu Henner, Mireille Enos, Sam Shepard, Kristin Wiig\n- Films: Carrie, The Divergent Series, The Fault in Our Stars, Baby Driver, Another Cinderella Story, Banshee Chapter, Hollidaysburg, Jonathan, Love On A Limb, Never Here, Periods, Hateship, Loveship\n- Roles: Tommy Ross, Caleb Prior, Augustus Waters, Baby, Debora\n- Topics: plot, executive production\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Ansel Elgort played Tommy Ross in the horror film \"Carrie\".\n- Neal Dodson executive produced \"Another Cinderella Story\" starring Selena Gomez and Jane Lynch, and he later executive produced \"Banshee Chapter,\" \"Hollidaysburg,\" \"Jonathan\" starring Ansel Elgort, \"Love On A Limb\" starring Ashley Williams and Marilu Henner, \"Never Here\" starring Mireille Enos and Sam Shepard, and \"Periods,\" while also co-producing \"Hateship, Loveship\" starring Kristin Wiig.\n- In 2014, Ansel Elgort played Augustus Waters in the romantic teen drama \"The Fault in Our Stars\".\n- Ansel Elgort played Caleb Prior in \"The Divergent Series\" franchise.\n- In 2017, Ansel Elgort played the title character in Edgar Wright's action thriller \"Baby Driver\".\n- In 2017, Lily James played Debora, the love interest of Baby, in \"Baby Driver\".\n- The plot of \"Baby Driver\" follows Baby, a young getaway driver and music lover who must work for a kingpin.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "913dd375-a1bf-5869-8df5-47192ae49bf1",
        "text": "Page: Ansel Elgort. Sentence: As a film actor, he played Tommy Ross in the horror film \"Carrie\" (2013), Caleb Prior in \"The Divergent Series \" franchise, Augustus Waters in the romantic teen drama \"The Fault in Our Stars\" (2014), and the title character in Edgar Wright's action thriller \"Baby Driver\" (2017).\nPage: Baby Driver. Sentence: The plot follows Baby, a young getaway driver and music lover who must work for a kingpin.\nPage: Neal Dodson. Sentence: Neal executive produced \"Another Cinderella Story\" staring Selena Gomez and Jane Lynch, \"Banshee Chapter\" starring Katia Winter, \"\"Hollidaysburg\"\" starring Rachel Keller, \"\"Jonathan\"\" starring Ansel Elgort, \"\"Love On A Limb\"\" starring Ashley Williams (actress) and Marilu Henner, \"Never Here\" starring Mireille Enos and Sam Shepard, and \"\"Periods\"\" as well as co-producing \"Hateship, Loveship\" starring Kristin Wiig.\nPage: Lily James. Sentence: In 2017 she played Debora, the love interest of the main character Baby, in the action film \"Baby Driver\".",
